      "text": "*sigh*~"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 8.9,
      "end_time": 12.0,
      "text": "It's a little hot,\nbut the water feels so nice♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 12.2,
      "end_time": 16.2,
      "text": "Yes, truly.\nIt's as if my fatigue is melting away...♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 18.0,
      "end_time": 19.3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 20.3,
      "end_time": 22.3,
      "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 22.6,
      "end_time": 23.4,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 23.6,
      "end_time": 25.3,
      "text": "P-Precia-san?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 33.1,
      "end_time": 35.5,
      "text": "Riri.\nThey are big."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 36.3,
      "end_time": 37.2,
      "text": "Unfair."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 37.4,
      "end_time": 38.1,
      "text": "W-what!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 38.3,
      "end_time": 41.1,
      "text": "I don't recall doing anything unfair..."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 41.5,
      "end_time": 42.4,
      "text": "Hehe"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 42.6,
      "end_time": 47.0,
      "text": "Riri-chan's \"heart\" is filled with love for Onii-san."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 47.4,
      "end_time": 49.5,
      "text": "...I can't lose either..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 49.7,
      "end_time": 52.6,
      "text": "Even you, Ria-san, what are you saying...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 53.0,
      "end_time": 56.3,
      "text": "Ugh... I'm feeling dizzy now..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 58.1,
      "end_time": 59.3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 59.2,
      "end_time": 60.5,
      "text": "Hehehehe♡"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 61.2,
      "end_time": 63.0,
      "text": "Someone's there."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 63.2,
      "end_time": 64.0,
      "text": "Huh?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 64.2,
      "end_time": 65.6,
      "text": "Izuna, does it feel good~?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 68.2,
      "end_time": 71.1,
      "text": "Hmph. They don't seem to have noticed."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 71.3,
      "end_time": 74.6,
      "text": "I thought I’d eavesdrop like a proper thief, but..."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 74.9,
      "end_time": 78.4,
      "text": "You lot aren't having any worthwhile conversation."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 79.4,
      "end_time": 80.6,
      "text": "You are──"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 86.2,
      "end_time": 88.1,
      "text": "Bandy Sisters!?"
    }
